{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570350/extras/91f31366114b78670d1d549503770818.avif?t=1773589888\" width=1560 height=528 /></span><br><strong>Silkgrove</strong>\u00a0is an open-world game set in a post-apocalyptic environment following a war between humans and machines. In the game, you take on the role of Annie, a young Restorer equipped with a set of tools and a mission to help rebuild the  world using sustainable practices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix things, craft new items, and explore to uncover stories from each place you visit. You can decorate your  home camp, meet interesting characters, and learn about the past world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play at your own pace, traveling through various environments, collecting resources, facing challenges, or simply camping and enjoying serene landscapes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570350/extras/f545dc5d796aa0647bc589317e86a9c6.poster.avif?t=1773589888\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570350/extras/f545dc5d796aa0647bc589317e86a9c6.webm?t=1773589888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570350/extras/f545dc5d796aa0647bc589317e86a9c6.mp4?t=1773589888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong>\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore an Open World</strong>: Journey through a  post-apocalyptic landscape filled with unique items, resources, and past world secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collecting and Scavenging</strong>: Gather materials and salvage items from the environment for your needs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft and Build</strong>: Use materials to create tools, scrape for materials, and upgrade your home camp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fixing and Maintenance</strong>: Repair broken items and maintain tools to keep everything running smoothly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farming</strong>: Grow  food, use hydroponics, monitor food forests, and manage resources sustainably to support your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong>: Collect and manage different resources to aid your progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camp Home</strong>: Camp, customize, and upgrade your mobile camp home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Stories</strong>: Find out about the past and meet new characters.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570350/extras/fd997b2acfd8a719d185d617ecd41ae7.poster.avif?t=1773589888\" width=800 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570350/extras/fd997b2acfd8a719d185d617ecd41ae7.webm?t=1773589888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570350/extras/fd997b2acfd8a719d185d617ecd41ae7.mp4?t=1773589888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3570350?t=1773589888","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3570350?t=1773589888","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570350/8212e7842a8daa5b7b9f686f93e9e577deda16dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773589888","caps